"type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "id": 4}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Imagine you are at a dinner party.  They have made pulled pork and fries.  It looks fantastic.</span><br>\n\n<span class=\"italic\">Instructions:<br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Watch the video.<br><span class=\"bullet\">Write a 75 to 100 word journal entry about your meal.<br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Include who made the meal and where you were.<br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Describe how the meal looked and tasted. Use adjectives like tasty, juicy, and mouth-watering.<br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Use quantities and amounts like plateful.<br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Write in complete sentences and in paragraph form.<br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button. </span></span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Review your journal.</span><br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Remember to include:<br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>A description of who made the meal and the location</li> \n<li>Adjectives to describe the food </li><li>Quantifiers and amounts like <span class=\"italic\">container</span>, <span class=\"italic\">a lot</span>, and <span class=