bridge Life</span>.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>:  Thanks everyone. Wow, something smells good!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  That might be the pulled pork and poutine on the counter. Would you like some?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>:  Poutine? Isn't that French?", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Canadian actually, it's a winter favorite.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Here, I'll make up a plate for you while you're putting your sax away. How much would you like?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>:  I'll have a plateful of the meat and a sampling of the poutine.  Oh and can I have some Caesar salad on the side?", "time": "23000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure, no problem. By the way, these recipes are going to be in my cookbook. Right now, I'm collecting recipes in my food journal.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: What a great idea! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She is an amazing chef and restaurant manager.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: Talented indeed! I'm a bit of a foodie myself. I like to try new restaurants around town.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I'm sure you'll be one of the first to receive Vanessa Cooks, her first edition.", "time": "37500", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn6le16ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "What is a short journal?", "time": "5050", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "A journal is a place where you can express your thoughts and ideas about a subject.", "time": "26750", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "text": "You can write about general things.", "time": "41150", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data"